  "Software Details": "Détails du logiciel",
  "The Dash Saas Bookings Module makes managing your appointments simple and hassle-free. Our easy-to-use interface lets you set up and adjust booking slots quickly, ensuring your calendar is always up-to-date. Whether you are a solo business owner or managing a team, our scheduling tool adapts to your needs. From one-time meetings to recurring appointments, you’ll stay organized and in control with ease.": "Le module de réservation Dash Saas rend la gestion de vos rendez-vous simple et sans tracas. ",
  "/Month": "/Mois",
  "/Year": "/Année",
  "Buy Now": "Acheter maintenant",
  "View Live Demo": "Voir la démo en direct",
  "Simplify Your Schedule with Dash SaaS Booking Module": "Simplifiez votre emploi du temps avec le module de réservation Dash SaaS",
  "Streamline your scheduling with Dash SaaS Booking. Integrated seamlessly into the Dash Saas platform, our intuitive module minimizes conflicts and enhances customer satisfaction. Simplify appointments effortlessly.": "Rationalisez votre planification avec Dash SaaS Booking. ",
  "Great Customer Experience": "Excellente expérience client",
  "Providing a great customer experience is simple with the Dash Saas Bookings Module. Clients can book appointments anytime through an easy online portal. Automatic confirmations and reminders help reduce no-shows, keeping everyone informed and prepared. The seamless integration with your website and social media allows clients to book services without leaving their favorite platforms, making the process smooth and convenient.": "Offrir une expérience client exceptionnelle est simple avec le module de réservation Dash Saas. ",
  "Easy Integration and Customization": "Intégration et personnalisation faciles",
  "Our Bookings Module works well with the tools you already use. Easily integrate with popular calendar apps like Google Calendar and Outlook to keep all your schedules in sync. Customize booking forms and workflows to fit your business needs. Whether you need to collect detailed information upfront or offer different service options, our module allows you to create a booking experience that matches your brand.": "Notre module de réservation fonctionne bien avec les outils que vous utilisez déjà. ",
  "Useful Analytics": "Analyses utiles",
  "Get valuable insights into your booking trends and business performance with the Dash Saas Bookings Module/s analytics. Track important metrics like appointment numbers, peak booking times, and customer preferences. Use this data to make better decisions about staffing, marketing, and services. Our simple reports and dashboards give you a clear view of how your booking system is doing, helping you improve efficiency and profitability. Plus, you can manage bookings from both the backend and frontend, giving you complete control and flexibility over your scheduling process.": "Obtenez des informations précieuses sur vos tendances de réservation et vos performances commerciales grâce aux analyses du module de réservation Dash Saas. ",
  "Online Payments": "Paiements en ligne",
  "With the Dash Saas Bookings Module, customers can pay for their appointments online quickly and securely. We support major payment gateways like Stripe and PayPal, making it easy for clients to complete transactions. This feature not only enhances convenience but also ensures that payments are processed efficiently, reducing the risk of missed payments and improving your cash flow. Offering online payment options helps streamline your business operations and provides a seamless experience for your customers.": "Avec le module de réservation Dash Saas, les clients peuvent payer leurs rendez-vous en ligne rapidement et en toute sécurité. ",
  "Why choose dedicated modules": "Pourquoi choisir des modules dédiés",
  "for your business?": "pour votre entreprise ?",
  "With Dash, you can conveniently manage all your business functions from a single location": "Avec Dash, vous pouvez gérer facilement toutes les fonctions de votre entreprise à partir d'un seul endroit",
  "Empower Your Workforce with DASH": "Donnez du pouvoir à votre personnel avec DASH",
